{"speciesId":674,"names":{"fr":"Pandespiègle","es":"Pancham","en":"Pancham","ja":"ヤンチャム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il fait son possible pour intimider ses adversaires avec un regard menaçant, mais sans succès. Il a l’habitude de constamment mâcher une feuille."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se esfuerza mucho para que el enemigo no lo menosprecie, pero su mirada no intimida demasiado. Se caracteriza por mascar siempre una hoja."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It does its best to be taken seriously by its enemies, but its glare is not sufficiently intimidating. Chewing on a leaf is its trademark."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"敵に なめられないよう がんばって にらみつけるが 効果は 薄い。 くわえた 葉っぱが トレードマーク。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il fait de son mieux pour avoir un air patibulaire, mais il sourit béatement dès qu’on lui caresse la tête."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se desvive tratando de fulminar a su rival con una mirada aterradora, pero en cuanto le acarician la cabeza, no puede evitar sonreír de oreja a oreja."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It does its level best to glare and pull a scary face, but it can’t help grinning if anyone pats its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"一生懸命 怖い 顔で 相手を にらみつけるが 頭を なでられると つい にやけてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il fait son possible pour intimider ses adversaires avec un regard menaçant, mais sans succès. Il a l’habitude de constamment mâcher une feuille."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se esfuerza mucho para que el enemigo no lo menosprecie, pero su mirada no intimida demasiado. Se caracteriza por mascar siempre una hoja."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It does its best to be taken seriously by its enemies, but its glare is not sufficiently intimidating. Chewing on a leaf is its trademark."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"敵に なめられないよう がんばって にらみつけるが 効果は 薄い。 くわえた 葉っぱが トレードマーク。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il fait de son mieux pour avoir un air patibulaire, mais il sourit béatement dès qu’on lui caresse la tête."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Se desvive tratando de fulminar a su rival con una mirada aterradora, pero en cuanto le acarician la cabeza, no puede evitar sonreír de oreja a oreja."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It does its level best to glare and pull a scary face, but it can’t help grinning if anyone pats its head."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"一生懸命 怖い 顔で 相手を にらみつけるが 頭を なでられると つい にやけてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il grandit en copiant les poses et les mimiques de ce gros cador de Pandarbare, qu’il considère comme son mentor."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"En su afán por madurar, toma como modelo a Pangoro, hacia el que profesa sumo respeto. Para él es como una especie de mentor."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It grows up imitating the behavior of Pangoro, which it looks up to as a leader."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"親分の ように 慕っている ゴロンダの 仕草を 真似ながら 一人前に なっていくぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"C’est juste pour se donner un air qu’il mâche une feuille. Comme c’est un petit galopin, il est déconseillé aux Dresseurs inexpérimentés."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Solo masca la hoja que lleva porque le gusta el aire que le confiere. Su carácter pícaro lo hace incompatible con los Entrenadores novatos."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"There’s no point to the leaf in its mouth, aside from an effort to look cool. It’s mischievous, so it’s not well suited to inexperienced Trainers."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"咥えている 葉っぱに 意味は なく ただの かっこつけ。 やんちゃなので 素人トレーナーには 向かない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il suit Pandarbare comme son ombre et le considère comme son chef. S’il fait une grosse bêtise, on lui confisque sa feuille."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Sigue los pasos de Pangoro, a quien considera su maestro. En caso de cometer un grave error, este le arrebata la hierba de la boca."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It follows Pangoro around like a henchman. When Pancham makes a big mistake, its leaf gets taken away."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"ゴロンダの あとを 子分の ように ついていく。 大きな 失敗を すると 葉っぱを 取られてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il essaie à tout prix d’intimider son adversaire. S’il vous fait les gros yeux, faites-lui plaisir et prenez l’air apeuré !"},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Intenta amedrentar a su oponente a toda costa. Si fija la mirada en alguien, solo hay que aparentar tener miedo para hacerlo feliz."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s desperate to intimidate its opponents. Be nice and pretend to be scared if you catch it glaring at you intensely."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"相手を ビビらせようと 必死。 一生懸命 睨んできたら 怖がるふりを してあげよう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"C’est en copiant son mentor, Pandarbare, qu’il apprend toutes les ficelles du métier, de l’art du combat à la capture des proies."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sigue los pasos de Pangoro, a quien considera su mentor. A base de imitarlo, aprende a combatir y a cazar presas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It chooses a Pangoro as its master and then imitates its master’s actions. This is how it learns to battle and hunt for prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"親分と 慕う ゴロンダの 真似を する ことで 戦い方や 獲物の 捕まえ方を 学ぶ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il dévisage toujours ses adversaires d’un air renfrogné pour être pris au sérieux, mais dès que la tension retombe, son sourire reprend le dessus."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Siempre lanza una mirada fulminante al rival para que no lo menosprecie, pero en cuanto se relaja esboza sin querer una sonrisa."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Wanting to make sure it’s taken seriously, Pancham’s always giving others a glare. But if it’s not focusing, it ends up smiling."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"なめられないように いつも 相手を 睨みつけているが 気が 緩むと つい 笑い顔に なってしまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":674,"moves":[{"name":"karate-chop","learns":[[15,"level-up",12],[16,"level-up",12],[17,"level-up",12],[18,"level-up",12]]},{"name":"comet-punch","learns":[[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[15,"level-up",33],[16,"level-up",33],[17,"level-up",33],[18,"level-up",33],[20,"level-up",36],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"low-kick","learns":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"seismic-toss","learns":[[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"